    "updated_at": "2021-01-06T19:21:30Z",
    "body": "Your rustc is likely too old and needs to be upgraded. We don't formally track what the oldest supported version of rustc is, so the (implicit) assumption is that you'll have the latest stable rustc (which as of right now is 1.49)\r\n\r\nIf you installed with rustup, this should be as simple as running `rustup update`",
